<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hybla</span></b> , ae, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hyblē</span></b> , ēs, f.,
			=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὕβλη</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a mountain of Sicily abounding in flowers
				and bees</i>, <i>with a city of the same
			name</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 13, 13, § 32</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. E. 7,
				37</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. Tr. 5, 13, 22</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 14,
				200</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 7, 88, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 12, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7,
				16</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hy-blaeus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to Mount Hybla</i>, <i>Hyblean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">apes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					E. 1, 55</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mella,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mart.
					11, 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">avena,</span>”
				i. e. <i>of the Sicilian Theocritus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Calp.
					Ecl. 4, 6, 3</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Hyblenses</span></b> ,
				ĭum, m., <i>the inhabitants of the city of Hybla</i>, <i>Hybleans</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 8, 14, § 91</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 3, 43, §
		102</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
